IDD_ABOUT DIALOGEX 50, 43, 224, 128
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_MODALFRAME | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU
CAPTION "About TEA"
FONT 8, "MS Shell Dlg"
